Description: drop usr/share/man from librsvg2-bin.install for nodoc builds
 `debian/librsvg2-bin.install` lists two paths to install into the
 `librsvg2-bin` binary package:
 .
   usr/bin
   usr/share/man
 .
 The first claims `/usr/bin/rsvg-convert` (the rsvg-convert(1) CLI).
 The second claims the man pages associated with that binary.
 .
 Under `DEB_BUILD_PROFILES=nodoc` (Athena's default — `[Source]
 BuildProfiles = nodoc, nocheck` in build.conf), the librsvg upstream
 build system doesn't generate man pages.  `usr/share/man` is then
 absent from `debian/tmp/` and `dh_install --fail-missing` (the
 default in `debhelper-compat (= 13)`) aborts:
 .
   dh_install: warning: librsvg2-bin missing files: usr/share/man
   dh_install: error: missing files, aborting
   make[1]: *** [debian/rules:52: override_dh_install] Error 25
 .
 Drop the `usr/share/man` line.  Under nodoc the man page wasn't
 going to be shipped anyway; under a hypothetical full build the
 rsvg-convert(1) page would generate but go unshipped (a minor
 documentation regression we accept since Athena always builds
 with `nodoc`).
 .
 If a future Athena variant needs to ship the man page, gate the
 line dynamically in `debian/rules`'s `override_dh_install` rather
 than re-adding it unconditionally — a re-add would re-introduce
 this exact failure mode.
 .
 Surfaced during GROUPS-01 phase 3 gnome build 2026-05-14 —
 librsvg is pulled in transitively by gnome-shell (SVG icon and
 background rendering via the gdk-pixbuf loader).
Author: Harkirat S Virk <harkiratsvirk@gmail.com>
Origin: local
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-05-15
---
This patch header follows DEP-3: http://dep.debian.net/deps/dep3/
--- a/debian/librsvg2-bin.install
+++ b/debian/librsvg2-bin.install
@@ -1,2 +1 @@
 usr/bin
-usr/share/man
